This product runs on and includes work from:

- ArWen / gpuwm (FahrenheitResearch), the GPU port of the WRF-ARW dynamical core and physics that does the
  atmosphere. Apache License 2.0. Installed by Setup.cmd as the "gpuwm" package (not included in this source);
  its own LICENSE and third-party notices ship with it.
- The Weather Research and Forecasting model (WRF), NCAR / UCAR, which ArWen ports.

Map and ground data in data/ (each folder's SOURCES.md has the details and download links):

- US Census Bureau cartographic boundaries and incorporated places (public domain, 17 U.S.C. 105).
- Natural Earth (public domain).
- GMTED2010 terrain, USGS / NGA (public domain).
- MODIS land use (WRF's WPS_GEOG modis_landuse_20class_30s, NCAR / UCAR; NASA MODIS data, free of restrictions).
- Iowa Environmental Mesonet station list (Iowa State University).
